6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17073, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01N2KD6HzEXyE1nvyzoPe744", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback and it completed: us-east, us-west, and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. Post-rollback status is healthy with error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy and should not be redeployed until root-caused. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47673, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N2KD6HzEXyE1nvyzoPe744", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47673, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N2KD6HzEXyE1nvyzoPe744", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 48599, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017rVMZQzLVLdWRgDLVmg39i", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48899, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017rVMZQzLVLdWRgDLVmg39i", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48899, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017rVMZQzLVLdWRgDLVmg39i", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51231, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was the unhealthy release. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that had been healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. No change-manager approval was needed because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed. I retried once and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open with the correct SEV2 severity, title and summary, so I did not create a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the cause of the v2.3.1 health-check failures before it is redeployed, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01AwRECpEVRVSfpoUeXXb6ny", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01E2jsPrikLXuWui1gKhtVKq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The current release is v2.3.1, which is unhealthy in production. The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0, so I'll roll back to it.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ViqEWoWprt1bTvpapbZn8i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure. I'll check the current state of each region before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Cj37dcX3fioXuk2AMFVNEc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped after us-east, so us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to v2.3.0 is the approved action, so I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Kc2WskpLwiY7DzftLpqCvP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FKNmjV9C4Vg1EAmDthawR6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy. Next I'll open the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01N2KD6HzEXyE1nvyzoPe744", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback and it completed: us-east, us-west, and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. Post-rollback status is healthy with error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy and should not be redeployed until root-caused. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out, so it may or may not have been created. I'll check the incident list before retrying to avoid a duplicate page.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017rVMZQzLVLdWRgDLVmg39i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was the unhealthy release. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that had been healthy in production, so I rolled back to it. No change-manager approval was needed because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed. I retried once and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open with the correct SEV2 severity, title and summary, so I did not create a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the cause of the v2.3.1 health-check failures before it is redeployed, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout.", "type": "text"}]}]}